BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 535.55 Tm (The fastest way to kill a qui tam is to go loud. Levin Papantonio's James Kaufman says the urge to get the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 520.32 Tm (word out can blow the case: going to the newspaper or press dumps the information into the public, strips its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 505.10 Tm (value to the government, and risks the public disclosure bar that ends original-source status [xH5IpDAiP5c) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 489.87 Tm (@ 00:00:36]. The panel calls it counterintuitive: the instinct to shout it to the rooftops to save people money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 474.65 Tm (or get them out of harm's way is the absolute worst thing you could do. Publicity also raises the odds that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 459.42 Tm (someone else files first and blocks the relator in line. Brown frames the same clock bluntly: the first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 444.20 Tm (whistleblower to file generally blocks everyone behind them, and another day someone else may file your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 428.97 Tm (case [Hb6Ogl9Fm8I @ 00:09:15]. Seal discipline continues after filing. Munter warns that once a case is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 413.75 Tm (under seal the relator cannot tell anyone except the lawyer, which is why Munter says you have to marry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 398.52 Tm (your lawyer at that point [KMtkKgsZzRo @ 00:01:03]. Brown adds that posting case-specific questions in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 383.30 Tm (public comments can only compromise the case, and that experienced defense counsel will start suspecting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 368.07 Tm (a hidden False Claims Act action once government demands keep circling the same subject) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 352.85 Tm ([N4uuM9uvRYY @ 00:06:35].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.62 Tm (Relators with dirty hands face a different failure mode. Brown says big sources bring big problems, and that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 322.40 Tm (once a whistleblower's own conduct can be questioned the strategy flips from chasing an award to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.17 Tm (protection. Under the False Claims Act, a relator who planned and initiated the violation can see the award) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.95 Tm (reduced, and one convicted of criminal conduct arising from it is dismissed from the civil action and receives) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 276.72 Tm (nothing [CZeUV80NaAA @ 00:02:12]. The biggest misconception Brown flags is immunity: a whistleblower) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 261.50 Tm (submission is not an immunity agreement, and the reward track and the criminal cooperation track are two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 246.27 Tm (different things that can overlap and sometimes conflict [CZeUV80NaAA @ 00:05:24]. Brown's six-rung) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.05 Tm (ladder runs from minimal involvement through knowing participant, manager or approver, planner or initiator,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.82 Tm (and finally obstruction, meaning destroyed evidence, altered records, lies, or interference with investigators,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.60 Tm (with exposure rising at every rung and with every dollar of direct benefit. Teller flags a quieter version of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.37 Tm (trap: settle a related retaliation claim carelessly and the relator might accidentally settle the False Claims Act) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.15 Tm (case out from under the government, though Teller says it is rare [SiATzxJHy2Y @ 00:06:26]. Brown adds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.92 Tm (that HR will ask why the employee waited a year or two and treat that delay as grounds for termination) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 139.70 Tm ([Cz4DaWsS-xM @ 00:07:46].) Tj ET
