BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (and the panel flags that "rummaging" is a factor and that the CFAA criminalizes unauthorized access, so the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (better play is telling the government where documents sit so it can subpoena them [JN4iipJiHZM @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (00:09:12]. Privilege is the second trap: David Wiseman warns that privileged productions delay DOJ, force) Tj ET
