BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (the same line from the relator side: never take documents you would not normally access, be targeted, avoid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (work email and work machines, and never feed case data to AI because it is not privileged, can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (subpoenaed, and gives wrong legal answers [H0ay64A0XXA @ 00:10:52]. Hamilton's verdict on overreach:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (it "can very quickly undermine the legitimacy of a case and it can get you in trouble all on its own.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Seal breaches and settlement paperwork are where money leaks after the case is already won. The ABA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (panel stresses that "it's not an automatic dismissal if the relator breaches the seal," but the bill still comes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (due: in Bibi v. Wells Fargo, DOJ recommended $2.7M, the share above the 25 percent minimum, and the) Tj ET
