BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (insurers create a catch-22, so Paulus seeks an extra partial lift. Sarah Frazier warns that a common reason) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (for a government veto is too much of the settlement allocated to the retaliation claim, and the panel says to) Tj ET
