BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (The economics check is time, and every practitioner who has lived a case reports it running longer than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (planned. Blake Percival filed a sealed qui tam on July 1, 2011 through Beasley Allen after being fired in May) Tj ET
