BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (hedges the same play, warning that a criminal referral might accelerate a case but can increase the risk your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (identity is revealed or create criminal exposure, a fate some other IRS complainants have already suffered,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (so it is a strategy reserved for a clean whistleblower working it through counsel [tQIkb01vCTw @ 00:03:58].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Dean Zerbe sets a lower proof bar than the criminal-first crowd: you just need to show the target owes tax,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (and proving fraud is a nice bonus rather than a requirement [O45E7FrG_mM @ 00:17:40]. The criminal-first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (operators trade exposure risk for speed and traction, while the civil filers accept slower, quieter handling in) Tj ET
